# Repo-local link-check exceptions. Each entry is an exact URL verified alive
# and failing only because the publisher refuses automated clients. Shared
# excludes live in lychee.toml (synced from melodic-software/standards).

# cursor.directory answers 429 with `X-Vercel-Mitigated: challenge` (a Vercel
# bot checkpoint, not a rate limit) to lychee, curl and a browser User-Agent;
# a JavaScript-rendering fetch returned the live plugin index (verified
# 2026-10-11).
^https://cursor\.directory/?$
